# FlipGen Local Reseller Engine - Environment Configuration

# Optional: Firebase Authentication & Firestore Cloud Sync
# (Enables 1-Click Google Sign-in and instant laptop ↔ phone real-time sync)
# IMPORTANT: Put your private API key in .env.local (which is gitignored). Never commit keys to git!
